378 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The diagnosis and management of kidney tumors present significant clinical and technical challenges that this project aims to address. Manual interpretation of medical scans is often time-consuming, requires highly specialized expertise, and can be subject to inter-observer variability. This project targets the following specific problems:)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
379 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E <>
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
