/T (1.3 )
/E (1.3 )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
383 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Motivation of Project )
/E (Motivation of Project )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
384 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The motivation for undertaking this project is grounded in three core pillars that combine clinical need with technological opportunity:)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
385 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (1. Clinical Impact: The foremost motivation is the potential to improve patient outcomes. By enabling earlier and more accurate diagnoses and providing prognostic insights, this system can help clinicians devise more effective and timely treatment plans, potentially improving survival rates and quality of life.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
386 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (2. Technological Exploration: This project provides a valuable opportunity to apply advanced deep learning models, specifically Convolutional Neural Networks \(CNNs\), to a complex, real-world medical problem. It serves as an academic exploration into the challenges of medical image analysis, data preprocessing, and model validation in a high-stakes domain.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
387 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (3. Scalability: The system is designed as a foundational prototype. This architecture allows for future expansion, such as incorporating larger and more diverse datasets, integrating multi-modal data \(e.g., genomic and clinical data\), and adding more sophisticated predictive features, creating a pathway toward a comprehensive clinical tool.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
388 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/P 226 0 R
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
