<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The final results dashboard presents a comprehensive summary of the kidney tumor analysis performed by the model. Key outputs such as detection confidence, estimated tumor volume, predicted clinical stage, and annual growth rate are displayed prominently for quick interpretation. Detailed sections further elaborate on tumor location, malignancy likelihood, TNM staging, radiomic descriptors, and other clinically relevant findings. The structured layout and visual indicators enable an intuitive understanding of complex medical information, while the downloadable report option supports documentation for research or clinical review. This results module represents the culmination of the AI pipeline, transforming raw imaging data into actionable diagnostic insights.)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
